[I] Ini-File Handling

[T] c-ini is a C11 library from the c-util project implementing APIs to read
[T] and handle ini-files, human-readable files of grouped key-value pairs,
[T] supporting different format variants. It is used by dbus-broker.

[U] https://github.com/c-util/c-ini

[A] C-ini Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

